# --- Scraper output ---------------------------------------------------------
# Raw HTML snapshots are the actual backup, so they SHOULD be committed.
# They are kept out of npm/lint paths but deliberately NOT ignored here.
# If the snapshot set ever gets too large for git, switch to git-lfs rather
# than ignoring it -- losing these means losing the backup.
